1. Removed the import of `LayoutWrapper` since it couldn't be found
2. Replaced the `LayoutWrapper` component with a simple div that provides similar layout functionality
3. Kept all the necessary providers intact
4. Added some basic styling to maintain layout structure

This should resolve the import error while maintaining the functionality of the component. The layout is now handled directly in the preview component instead of relying on an external layout wrapper that wasn't accessible.

